      "description": "Fama-MacBeth regressions of \u0394RNOA_{t+1} on changes in DuPont components (4 model specifications).",
      "replication_meaning": "Validates the headline DuPont result (C1): that \u0394ATO is the only change component significantly predicting \u0394RNOA_{t+1} after controlling for \u0394RNOA and adding AB/RSST controls. Tests the change-form variable construction (\u0394PM, \u0394ATO, \u0394RNOA), the RSST accrual decomposition (\u0394WC, \u0394NCO, \u0394FIN), and the Fama-MacBeth 19-year annual regression methodology.",
      "covers_claims": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "paper_quote": "panel B of table 3 presents the changes specification used in prior studies. Consistent with prior literature (Fairfield and Yohn 2001; Penman and Zhang 2003), model 1 shows that only \u0394ATO is positive and significant in predicting future changes in RNOA.",
